---
title: SHACL Governance Structure
---
graph TB
    classDef owner fill:#1F4E79,color:#fff,stroke:#1F4E79,font-weight:bold
    classDef steward fill:#2E75B6,color:#fff,stroke:#2E75B6
    classDef artefact fill:#D6E4F0,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#2E75B6
    classDef policy fill:#BDD7EE,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#2E75B6
    classDef shacl fill:#EEF4F9,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#404040,stroke-dasharray:4 2

    SO["🔷 Schema Owner\n(Final authority on\nstructural changes)"]:::owner

    DS1["🔵 Domain Steward\nArea A"]:::steward
    DS2["🔵 Domain Steward\nArea B"]:::steward
    DSn["🔵 Domain Steward\nArea N"]:::steward

    BP["📋 Breaking Change Policy\n• Removing required property = BREAKING\n• Relaxing constraint = non-breaking\n• Adding optional property = non-breaking"]:::policy

    DP["📋 Deprecation Policy\n• sh:deactivated true (soft)\n• owl:deprecated annotation\n• Version-bearing IRI replacement"]:::policy

    VP["📋 Severity → Governance Mapping\n• sh:Violation — Schema Owner approved\n• sh:Warning — Domain Steward recommended\n• sh:Info — Documentation standard"]:::policy

    SCOPE["🔲 ex:inScope Annotation\nMachine-queryable scope enforcement\non every sh:NodeShape"]:::shacl

    CONF["🔲 sh:conformanceDisallows\nConfigured in Phase 0\nControls which severities\ntrigger sh:conforms false"]:::shacl

    REV["🔲 ex:revision Annotation\nQueryable history per shape:\ndate · author · usecase · breakingChange"]:::shacl

    SO --> DS1
    SO --> DS2
    SO --> DSn
    SO --> BP
    SO --> DP
    SO --> VP

    VP --> CONF
    BP --> SCOPE
    DP --> SCOPE
    SO --> REV

    CR["⚖️ Conflict Resolution Path\n1. Check governance table\n2. Severity compromise\n3. Shape bifurcation\n4. Schema Owner decides"]:::policy

    DS1 --> CR
    DS2 --> CR
    DSn --> CR
    CR --> SO
